<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas used an armed drone to kill a soldier in Cauca, while the Colombian Air Force bombed an ELN camp, killing at least three combatants. A Colombian army airstrike killed four suspected rebels, including a teenager, and a car bomb exploded outside a toll booth in the Cauca region. The United Nations urged Colombia to accelerate implementation of the 2016 peace accord and to uphold it, noting that armed groups now affect 28,000 people. FARC dissidents have carried out three car bombs on the Panamerican Highway in seven days. 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168580&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQZHVRY2JmVHRoUmpEV24xc2RlNTBRaEZDYXoxSGQ1SGJsX1BnSGVGaFdtWHRKYkMtRXFsLTRzZlRjTGtXZzVVOVNMNVpsQzhrWEtpTkFHQW5yYmxlNFBTOVlpNDJDQlExc201WV8yUUM0clNZa0ZZMnZGYlFEQnZOLXh5MzlUcUNEOTgwUDRqOXdfUUtCRjhVVGJzZ1pnS0xta3ZhNXpmYUw5cWlRVkRrQW9qWXhQQjliU3JlUGU0YkdsWjFDQ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPYWxLN29IN0F5a3pMbFFKcVlUelE3dFA4d3R5TS12Q1ZQRk5STTRWX0liWmtPNDNzZkNMcGx6RVpnb2xQZ0NyRTFCdHRHNDloTEhMaTQ5dTZPdnBra2RVTU1UaS1tV25rRlJxd0tFTXZkbEJrTzB5b1d4TWZuNjIyUWlheFN6MDRNRVRObHBfZWlFYzctczFYcVZXNk51MjRXNlplMUhkYmFqdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Huron Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOclV3dWlRemFfVWxERWFWR2ZEczJMVGljaE5PRG5ENVpHc1pvamRNQTc2aHduOW96LXYxNWFiWlZSZ2VmNlVKaUdVRGJ2SzFLWlVmdzQ0ZHlTbUhrcVZMQV9mX2JWUE1tRjdrOHlKZ1VYTnNWUkRXdUxYcTB1OGxtTmJtTFg1c09FajVUQTdXMEsxNEtIYVR2QUpkbXdJSk9MMGl6SGpTVUtmQVc3LXlZZldNemU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQYVl3UFlsZG9yR1lZOGRuVzJtXz